'''Cinnabar''' is a decorative [[stone]] variant [[block]] that naturally generates in [[sulfur caves]] alongside [[sulfur]].

== Obtaining ==
=== Breaking ===
Cinnabar drops as an item if mined by any [[pickaxe]]. If mined without a [[pickaxe]], it drops nothing.
{{Breaking row|Cinnabar|Pickaxe|Wood|horizontal=1}}

== Usage ==
=== Crafting ingredient ===
Cinnabar can be [[Crafting|craft]]ed into several decorative variants.

{{Crafting usage}}

=== Stonecutting ingredient ===
{{Stonecutting
|showname=1
|Cinnabar
|Cinnabar Slab, 2; Cinnabar Stairs; Cinnabar Wall; Polished Cinnabar; Polished Cinnabar Slab, 2; Polished Cinnabar Stairs; Polished Cinnabar Wall; Cinnabar Bricks; Cinnabar Brick Slab, 2; Cinnabar Brick Stairs; Cinnabar Brick Wall; Chiseled Cinnabar
|foot=1
}}

=== Sulfur cube ===
[[Sulfur cube]]s have the ability to absorb cinnabar, either through picking it up or being interacted with it. This provides the regular/football effect to the mob when hitting it.

